<title>BELGIUM: Italy to seek EU approval to pay off farm debts.</title>
<headline>Italy to seek EU approval to pay off farm debts.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy will seek approval to pay off 100 million ecus debts of 348 bankrupt farm cooperatives at a meeting of European Union farm ministers starting in Luxembourg on Monday, EU officials said.</p>
<p>Italy says that the aid is needed because of &quot;exceptional circumstances&quot; but needs the unanimous approval of EU farm ministers to override the European Commission's opposition.</p>
<p>The Commission, which argues that the Italian goverment's plan to pay off the debts over 10 years breaks EU state aid rules, has started legal proceedings against Rome. REUTER</p>
</text>
